  <goal>
    Introduce ONE shared `TenancyModel` enum + `TenancyModelParser` used **at the edge** (HTTP API + handler entry),
    then pass the typed value inward. Retire all 8 remaining branch-site string comparisons (B1–B8 per
    D-12-code-branch-inventory.md; B9 was Task 222). Retire the 4 silent defaults (D1–D4) — parse-or-reject at
    the edge replaces every silent default. Close the H1 P-2 defect (`CustomerOwnedTenancyValues` /
    `SpaarkeOwnedTenancyValues` retire the two *model* literals — keep the ownership vocabulary). Rewrite (not
    mechanically update) the one test that pins D3's defaulting as a contract. Close Task 222's deferred
    cleanups (Model1Shared/Model2Dedicated H3 consts + HandleModel2Async rename + W10 GraphAdminConsentVerifier
    sweep). Sweep the AP-12 doc-drift surface listed in inventory §5.

    Post-Item-2 result: **zero** string comparisons against `"Model1Shared"` / `"Model2Dedicated"` in production
    code. Every entry-point parses to enum + rejects on failure. Every handler branch is `switch(TenancyModel)`
    exhaustive-with-`default` (compile-time exhaustive per C# 12 warning, runtime `default` throws for future
    additions).

    **BINDING preservation** — the enum's `.ToString()` MUST produce the EXACT string values `"Model1Shared"` +
    `"Model2Dedicated"`. H12c's idempotency key (`h12c-{customerId}-{tenancyModel}-{hash}`) embeds this string;
    ANY completed H12c phase becomes invalidated if the format changes. Enum member names are chosen to
    round-trip identically. Cosmos wire format for `ProvisioningRun.TenancyModel` stays string (JSON serializer
    default). Item 3 (`sprk_tenancymodel` migration) is the atomic point where the string values themselves
    might change (fanning value 1 by Profile); Item 2 must NOT precipitate that change.

    NOT in scope (Item 3+ / Item 4 territory):
    - Migrating `sprk_tenancymodel` Dataverse column values (Item 3).
    - Retiring `model1-*.bicep` stacks (Item 4 atomic 7-surface change).
    - Section 6 six-item contradiction sweep (`scripts/provisioning-prereqs/prereqs.yaml` + canonical secret
      catalog manifest + Seed-PlatformKeyVault.ps1 + controlplane-worker-app-service.bicep +
      bff-runtime-rbac.bicep + controlplane-subscription-rbac.bicep).
  </goal>

